"# Award Winning\nHouse Cleaners\n##### Is it better to have a solo cleaner or a team of cleaners?\n\n[Is it better to have a solo cleaner or a team of cleaners?](https://innercitymaids.com.au/team-or-solo-cleaner-which-is-better/)\n\nWe have prepared more housekeeping cleaning service tips for our readers. Our aim is to help our clients and readers so they can learn how to get the most out of their housekeeping service. To see all of our articles click below;\n##### Why Booking the Right Amount of Cleaning Time Matters\n\n[Why Booking the Right Amount of Cleaning Time Matters](https://innercitymaids.com.au/why-booking-the-right-amount-of-cleaning-time-matters/)\n##### Hourly Rate or Fixed Price: Which is better?\n\n[Hourly Rate or Fixed Price: Which is better?](https://innercitymaids.com.au/hourly-cleaning-rate-or-flat-price-which-one-is-better/)\n##### How many hours of cleaning does my home need?\n\n[How many hours of cleaning does my home need?](https://innercitymaids.com.au/how-many-hours-of-cleaning-does-my-home-need/)\n##### The Truth About the “Premium” Label in Cleaning Services\n\n[The Truth About the “Premium” Label in Cleaning Services](https://innercitymaids.com.au/the-truth-about-premium-cleaning-services/)\n##### The Truth About Bargain Home Cleaners\n\n[The Truth About Bargain Home Cleaners](https://innercitymaids.com.au/the-truth-about-bargain-cleaners/)\n### Professional House Cleaning Services\n\nExperience award winning professional house cleaning services across Melbourne. Our cleaning agency provides experienced, police-checked house cleaners and housekeepers. Through our cleaning company, we're dedicated to freeing up your time with a variety of cleaning services, including regular cleaning, end of lease cleaning, spring cleaning, and deep cleaning.\n\nAll of our house cleaners are;\n\n✔️ Trained & Experienced\n\n✔️ Police Checked\n\n✔️ Reliable\n\n✔️ Trustworthy\n\n✔️ Friendly\n\nAs more than just cleaners in Melbourne, our domestic cleaners truly go above and beyond to make sure your home is immaculate.\n\nWe set the benchmarks that others follow.\n\nWe are proud to be a featured and registered member of the National Australian Cleaners Association (NACLA). We are proud to be a featured house cleaning service on the melbournemums.com.au community network.\n\nAccredited Cleaners Registry Member 🛡️\n\nNational Australian Cleaners Association\n\nFeatured House Cleaners on &##x1F44D;\n\nWhether it's regular cleaning, spring cleaning, vacate cleaning, or any kind of residential cleaning, we have you covered. With us, you're not just hiring a maid service; you're hiring a house maid that understands your needs.\n### Professional House Cleaning Services\n\nAward-winning professional house cleaning services across Melbourne, carried out by house cleaners who are:\n\n✔️ Trained & Experienced\n\n✔️ Police Checked\n\n✔️ Reliable Cleaners\n\n✔️ Trustworthy\n\n✔️ Friendly\n\n[View Prices & Book Online](https://innercitymaids.com.au/)\n\nWe set the benchmarks that others follow.\n\nAccredited Cleaners Registry Member 🛡️\n\nNational Australian Cleaners Association\n\nFeatured House Cleaners on &##x1F44D;\n### Simple hourly rates with no added fees & no lock in contracts!\nYou only pay for the hours you book.\n\nMost Popular\n### Regular Clean\n\nProducts Included ✅\n\nWeekly or Fortnightly cleans with no lock-in contracts\n\nReceive the same cleaner each time ✔\n\nNever worry about cleaning again\n\n[Gift card options 🎁](https://innercitymaids.com.au/gift-cards/)\n\n[Which tasks can be included?](https://innercitymaids.com.au/)\n### Once Off Clean\n\nProducts Included ✅\n\nA catch up clean so you can get back on top of things\n\nCan be scheduled on a casual basis\n\nIncludes the same tasks as a Regular Clean\n\n[Gift card options 🎁](https://innercitymaids.com.au/gift-cards/)\n\n[Which tasks can be included?](https://innercitymaids.com.au/)\n### Deep Clean\n\nProducts Included ✅\n\nAlso known as a Spring Clean / End of Lease Clean\n\nIncludes a wider range of cleaning tasks\n\nLet us take care of the difficult cleaning tasks\n\n[Gift card options 🎁](https://innercitymaids.com.au/gift-cards/)\n\n[Which tasks can be included?](https://innercitymaids.com.au/)\n##### 📣 Spotless Service, 1000+ Stellar Reviews! ★★★★★\n\n[🤐 Explore Reviews](https://innercitymaids.com.au/)\n##### 📣 Spotless Service, Stellar Reviews!\n\n[🤐 Explore Reviews](https://innercitymaids.com.au/)\n##### 📣 The Truth About Bargain Cleaners\n\nUnderstanding the reality behind rock-bottom prices and their often hidden trade offs.\n##### 📣 The Truth About “Premium” Cleaning\n\nSome companies label services “premium” to justify higher costs without added value.\n##### 📣 The Truth About Bargain Cleaners\n\nUnderstanding the reality behind rock-bottom prices and their often hidden trade offs.\n\n[Read Article](https://innercitymaids.com.au/the-truth-about-bargain-cleaners/)\n##### 📣 The Truth About “Premium” Cleaning\n\nSome companies label services “premium” to justify higher costs without added value.\n\n[Read Article](https://innercitymaids.com.au/the-truth-about-premium-cleaning-services/)\n### Deep Clean\n\n🔔 Use our mobile app for a faster and easier way to book a clean.\n#### Regular Clean\n\nWe specialise in recurring weekly and fortnightly cleans. Regular cleaning will ensure your home is always clean at all times.\n\n[Which tasks can be included?](https://innercitymaids.com.au/)\n#### Once Off Clean\n\nGreat choice for a catch-up clean so you can get back on top of things. Our professional house cleaners will give your home a once off general clean.\n\n[Which tasks can be included?](https://innercitymaids.com.au/)\n#### Deep Clean\n\nThis service is also known as a spring clean, end of lease clean or vacate clean. Let our house cleaners take care of the difficult cleaning tasks.\n\n[Which tasks can be included?](https://innercitymaids.com.au/)\n#### Regular Clean Tasks\n\nA Regular Clean is for weekly or fortnightly cleans. You will receive the same cleaner on the same day and time on a recurring basis.\n\nYou will never have to worry about general chores again.\n\n🔔 Services are hourly and the completion of each task depends on the total hours booked. Cleaning is only performed on internal areas.\n\nFull Bathroom Clean\n\nVacuum Floors\n\nMop Floors\n\nKitchen Surfaces\n\nHousekeeping (Upon Request)\n\nHousekeeping Requires Additional Time: Housekeeping tasks such as changing bedsheets, folding clothes, washing dishes, emptying kitchen/bathroom rubbish bins, and putting in new bin liners. Skirting boards and internal window cleaning can only be included if additional time has been booked specifically for these tasks. Please discuss these requirements with your cleaner.\n\n*Areas cleaned must be reachable by hand. We do not operate washing machines or dryers. We do not clean display areas with fragile trinkets and ornaments, electronics, nappy bins, pet waste, any kind of bio-hazard, external windows and any area outside of your home. Please do not request these tasks from any of our cleaners. Please do not supply your cleaner with a ladder or request them to use one. Mould removal is not included in any of our services.\n\n*We do not provide rubbish removal and collection services for accumulated household rubbish.\n\n*Need help estimating how many hours to book? [See our guide](https://innercitymaids.com.au/how-many-hours-of-cleaning-does-my-home-need/).\n\n*For more details on what can be included, along with [Inclusions](https://innercitymaids.com.au/tasks/) and [Exclusions](https://innercitymaids.com.au/tasks/), please view our Detailed Task List.\n#### Once Off Clean Tasks\n\nA Once Off Clean is a great option if you require a casual clean to get your place sparkling again. This service is not suitable for an end of lease/vacate clean.\n\n🔔 Services are hourly and the completion of each task depends on the total hours booked. Cleaning is only performed on internal areas.\n\nFull Bathroom Clean\n\nVacuum Floors\n\nMop Floors\n\nKitchen Surfaces\n\nHousekeeping (Upon Request)\n\nHousekeeping Requires Additional Time: Housekeeping tasks such as changing bedsheets, folding clothes, washing dishes, emptying kitchen/bathroom rubbish bins, and putting in new bin liners. Skirting boards and internal window cleaning can only be included if additional time has been booked specifically for these tasks. Please discuss these requirements with your cleaner.\n\n*Areas cleaned must be reachable by hand. We do not operate washing machines or dryers. We do not clean display areas with fragile trinkets and ornaments, electronics, nappy bins, pet waste, any kind of bio-hazard, external windows and any area outside of your home. Please do not request these tasks from any of our cleaners. Please do not supply your cleaner with a ladder or request them to use one. Mould removal is not included in any of our services.\n\n*We do not provide rubbish removal and collection services for accumulated household rubbish.\n\n*Need help estimating how many hours to book? [See our guide](https://innercitymaids.com.au/how-many-hours-of-cleaning-does-my-home-need/).\n\n*For more details on what can be included, along with [Inclusions](https://innercitymaids.com.au/tasks/) and [Exclusions](https://innercitymaids.com.au/tasks/), please view our Detailed Task List.\n#### Deep Clean Tasks\n\nThis clean is also known as a spring clean, end of lease clean, move in / move out clean.\n\n🔔 Services are hourly and the completion of each task depends on the total hours booked. Cleaning is only performed on internal areas.\n\nFull Bathroom Clean\n\nVacuum Floors\n\nMop Floors\n\nKitchen Surfaces\n\nOven and Rangehood Clean\n\nInternal Cabinet Clean\n\nWindow Clean\n\nOther Tasks\n\nDeep Clean Other Tasks: Blinds can be lightly dusted (upon request), walls can be spot cleaned (upon request), skirting boards wiped, architraves wiped, cobwebs removed, and bathroom ceiling exhaust fans cleaned. These tasks require additional time and can only be completed if sufficient hours are booked. We are unable to deep clean blinds or walls. Please communicate these requirements with your cleaner if you would like them included.\n\n*The client must supply a ladder with no more than 2 steps for the cleaning of bathroom ceiling exhaust fans or any other area that can’t be reached by hand (picture rails etc).\n\n*We do not operate washing machines or dryers. We do not clean display areas with fragile trinkets and ornaments, electronics, nappy bins, pet waste, any kind of bio-hazard, light fittings, heating ducts, BBQs, external windows and any area outside of your home. Please do not request these tasks from any of our cleaners. Mould removal is not included in any of our services.\n\n*We do not provide carpet steam cleaning services, rubbish removal and collection services for accumulated household rubbish.\n\n*Need help estimating how many hours to book? [See our guide](https://innercitymaids.com.au/how-many-hours-of-cleaning-does-my-home-need/).\n\n*For more details on what can be included, along with [Inclusions](https://innercitymaids.com.au/tasks/) and [Exclusions](https://innercitymaids.com.au/tasks/), please view our Detailed Task List.\n\n🔔 Use our mobile app for a faster and easier way to book a clean.\n##### Professional House Cleaning Services Team\n\nWe are a women-led cleaning agency that provides experienced, professional house cleaners to our clients. Each of our registered cleaners is carefully selected and is friendly, trustworthy, and reliable. We are confident you will love the dedicated home cleaner assigned to you.\n#### Am I locked into any contracts?\n\nAbsolutely not. There are no lock-in contracts.\n#### How many hours of cleaning will my home need?\n\nThe size and condition of your home will determine how many hours are required. There is no such thing as a typical home, or typical homeowner. Every home will have different areas that require cleaning, floor types, number of rooms, pets/no pets etc. That’s why we always suggest you guide our cleaners as to your priority areas. Services are hourly and the completion of each task depends on the total hours booked.\n\nWe don’t believe in ‘fixed price’ quotes, as they are too rigid, rather, we will set an agreed upon hourly rate. This format allows the freedom to choose what, and where, we will clean, and enables you to always stay within your desired budget.\n\nAnd if you need extra cleaning done, or require something special, you increase the number of hours – simple! Total hours booked equals total payment due.\n\nNot sure how many hours your cleaning task will need? To help our clients, we’ve prepared an information sheet on duties and hours. You’ll find that information sheet by [Clicking Here.](https://innercitymaids.com.au/how-many-hours-of-regular-cleaning-does-my-home-need/)\n#### Can you come to my home for a quote?\n\nOur team of professional cleaners are hand-selected and know their vocation. Because we know how efficient and thorough our cleaners are, we don’t need to waste your valuable time on home-visit quotes.\n\nStep one: You book us.\n\nStep two: You instruct your cleaner on what needs to be done.\n\nStep three: You sit back, or go for a coffee with a friend, while we complete the task.\n\nStep four: You return to a gleaming home & pay the EXACT agreed amount determined by the hours you booked.\n\nEverything is set out, clear and straightforward. We don’t charge hidden fees, or ‘administrative charges’ – we charge a flat, easy to understand, simple to calculate, hourly rate. That’s it. If you book one of our cleaners for 3-hours, you pay for 3-hours, if for 5, you pay for 5-hours. No mess, no fuss, no confusion.\n\nIf you’d like more information, please see our [detailed explanation on the benefits of choosing hourly rates over a set price](https://innercitymaids.com.au/hourly-cleaning-rate-or-flat-price-which-one-is-better/).\n#### How many cleaners come to clean my home?\n\nCleaning is usually carried out by one person.\n#### Can I get the same cleaner each time?\n\nAbsolutely! If you book a Regular Clean, you will be assigned the same person you have come to know and trust. In the event your cleaner unable to attend, we will contact you to arrange temporary a replacement cleaner, with your approval.\n#### Do I need to be home when the cleaner comes?\n\nThat’s your choice, however it’s not necessary for you to be present when your cleaner arrives. If you’re not going to be home to let the cleaner in, you can make a prior arrangement for your cleaner to collect the house-key from a pre-determined place on your property. Many of our clients prefer to invest in a key combination safe. It’s an ideal way to ensure your cleaner has access to your home, but no one else does. It’s also our preferred, and recommend, key-access method.\n\nWhen the job is completed, your cleaner will return the key back to its same location, or if preferred, your cleaner can also leave the key inside your home and lock the front door upon exiting.\n\nAt the time of your first booking, you may wish to take the opportunity to meet your cleaner and walk them through your home. You can also use this occasion to show them where your house key is to be left, on the days you will not be home.\n\nIf you would like to read more about when the cleaner will arrive & how to provide access please [Click Here.](https://innercitymaids.com.au/when-will-my-cleaner-arrive-how-will-i-provide-access/)\n#### Can I change my scheduled appointment day/time?\n\nWe understand that things change, or unique situations arise, and you may need to change your appointment day/time. If you need to change, or cancel your scheduled cleaning appointment please contact us as soon as practicable so that we can re-book your clean, and/or allocate you a suitable cleaner, for your new time spot.\n#### Do you service all areas of Melbourne, including outer suburbs?\n\nYes, we provide house cleaning services across most of Melbourne, including inner suburbs, middle suburbs and selected outer suburbs. The services available can vary slightly by location, so please use our [Postcode Checker](https://innercitymaids.com.au/) to confirm availability in your area. Our goal is to deliver Melbourne’s best house cleaning service — wherever possible around the city.\n#### Can I purchase gift cards?\n\nAbsolutely! You can purchase gift cards which will be emailed to the recipient instantly. You can purchase gift cards [here.](https://innercitymaids.com.au/gift-cards/)\n#### Can I give the cleaner a key?\n\nOur cleaners are not to be given client keys, for security purposes.\n\nIf you’re unable to be home when the cleaner arrives, we have a procedure in place. Please refer above, to ‘Do I need to be home when the cleaner comes?’ for our policy on cleaner access when our client isn’t home. If you would like to read more about when the cleaner will arrive & how to provide access please [Click Here.](https://innercitymaids.com.au/when-will-my-cleaner-arrive-how-will-i-provide-access/)\n#### Do I need to provide cleaning equipment and products?\n\nYour cleaner will bring all the required cleaning products for your appointment, however, for hygiene purposes, your cleaner will use your vacuum and mop. Using your equipment is essential to prevent cross contamination. If you would like to read more about products and equipment please [Click Here.](https://innercitymaids.com.au/products-equipment-for-your-appointment/)\n#### How do I pay for the cleaning service?\n\nPayment is made directly to your cleaner, after completion of the service, and not to Inner City Maids, via cash or bank deposit.\n\nFor NDIS, Veteran Affairs, insurance and aged care recipients, your cleaner will invoice your provider for payment.\n#### Can I get a receipt?\n\nAll our cleaners can provide a receipt for their cleaning services. If you would like a receipt after each clean, please advise your cleaner.\n#### Can I change my house cleaner if I am unhappy?\n\nYes. If for any reason you are unhappy with your cleaner, please contact us ASAP. After determining why your cleaner wasn’t suitable, we will assign you a better matched cleaner. Client satisfaction is the cornerstone of our business.\n#### Is the cleaner coming to my home trustworthy?\n\nEvery single one of our cleaners must pass a set of rigid selection criteria before being registered with us. Our lengthy selection and registration process begins with a pre-interview, quality and high standard of work confirmation check, procedures and protocols check, cleaning experience confirmation, character assessment and finally, they are police checked. You can rest assured all of our cleaners are trustworthy, reliable and experienced.\n#### Will I be overcharged if my cleaner runs out of time?\n\nYou will never be overcharged if your cleaner runs out of time. Your cleaner will only clean for the duration of hours that you have booked. All Services are hourly and the completion of each task depends on the total hours booked. The total hours and appointment price is always confirmed with you during the booking process so there are never any surprises. Unless you agree to increase the hours of an appointment, the total appointment price will not change.\n### Melbourne cleaning agency that consistently ensures the same high standard clean\n\nWe take cleaning very seriously, which is why we put in the hard work to ensure we find the absolute best people to clean your home. Our extensive knowledge, and stringent recruitment process, has been developed and perfected over many years. The benefit of using our cleaning agency is your complete peace of mind, knowing your assigned home cleaner will always be honest, dependable, reliable, and experienced!\n\nEach cleaner registered with our agency has successfully completed the below steps.\n\nPre-Screen Interview\n\nSkills & Experience Assessment\n\nPolice Check\n### What Clients Say About Our House Cleaners\n\nI have been very happy with our cleaner and the support and communication provided by the company. It’s hard to find a good cleaning company that you can trust to do a consistently perfect job. I became aware of Inner City Maids through a colleague after discussing the issues I had with my previous cleaner. This company is a cut above other cleaning companies out there.\n#### Tanya – St Kilda\n\nWe have a 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom townhouse in Footscray. Our cleaner comes once a week for 2 hours and cleans our entire home. We are pleased with the service and always happy to see our cleaner, who arrives with a big smile.\n#### Louise – Footscray\n\nAfter having a bad experience with my previous cleaner, a local mum recommended Inner City Maids. I am also a mum with a 1-year-old and a 3-year-old and always have my hands full. My cleaner, Ana, is my saviour who comes to clean once a week, leaving my place shining.\n#### Michelle – Newport\n\nI met my cleaner, Kimberly, for the initial appointment of an arranged fortnightly service. She was presentable and friendly. Now, I just leave her a key and always come back to a sparkling home. I have used other cleaning companies before and have found them to be average. However, my experience with Inner City Maids has been consistently nothing but great.\n#### Jenny – Maribyrnong\n\nI use Inner City Maids to clean my apartment in Prahran. My cleaner, Marisa, is lovely and does a fantastic job. I’m very pleased with the service.\n#### Sarah – Prahran\n\nI was very impressed with Adriana’s cleaning. She was friendly and did a fantastic job cleaning our house in Kingsville. I know how hard it is to find a good cleaner in the inner west of Melbourne, as I had used many different cleaners in the past and was never completely happy. Either I had a trust concern, found them to be unreliable, or the cleaning was just not up to standard. I was recommended this agency in a mums’ group on social media, and I have also passed on the recommendations to other mums in the group.\n#### Alycia – Kingsville\n\nWe have a large 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom house in Essendon, which is very time-consuming to clean. I am a mum with three little children, and the thought of adding cleaning to my already hectic schedule is daunting. Our cleaner, Jordana, is truly incredible. She does a fantastic job on the bathrooms and floors, which are my priority areas for cleaning. I have used many cleaners in the past, but this company is by far the best and I am glad to have found them through recommendations.\n#### Karen – Essendon\n\nI don’t know what I would do without my cleaner, Carol. She is the sweetest person and does a brilliant job cleaning my home in Fitzroy. I am very satisfied with the cleaning service and professionalism of the agency.\n#### Suzy – Fitzroy\n\nI’m a mum with two little children who constantly keep me busy. Having a cleaner come once a week to clean our place in Yarraville has been life-changing. I could never go back to not having a cleaner. I can comfortably recommend this agency to other mums with children in the inner west of Melbourne.\n#### Kate – Yarraville\n\nA cleaning company with a professional approach to cleaning and high standards. After many less than desirable experiences with other cleaners, I am finally relieved to have found a cleaning company that I am truly happy with.\n#### Kelly – Williamstown\n\nQuality cleaning company with reliable cleaners. Our house is in South Yarra, and our cleaner has always been punctual, delivering a consistently clean home. I can recommend this company to others without any hesitation.\n#### Melanie – South Yarra\n\nWe live in Altona North and now have our second cleaner from the agency servicing our home. We were very happy with the first one, but she went overseas. Our current cleaner, Carol, is also excellent and delivers the same quality of cleaning. I appreciate the consistency in the quality of cleaners this company provides. When I used other companies in the past, they lacked consistency and the cleaning I received varied all the time. I plan to use Inner City Maids for the foreseeable future and will recommend them to friends and family without any hesitation.\n#### Julie – Altona North\n\nI work seven days a week in the printing press industry, leaving me hardly any time for household chores. My cleaner comes once a fortnight and takes care of everything. I never have to think about cleaning.\n#### Mark – Richmond\n\nI found the cleaning booking process to be quick and intuitive. The customer service representative I spoke to was very polite and helpful. The cleaner who came out to clean my home in Ascot Vale did a terrific job. From start to finish, I was very impressed with the customer service, communication, and cleaning service. I can confidently say this company is unlike other cleaning companies or private cleaners I have used in the past. It’s comforting to deal with a large, trustworthy, and consistent company.\n#### Melissa – Ascot Vale\n\nThis company truly delivers on their quality promise. They are exactly as they claim to be and have never let me down with their home cleaners.\n#### Alison – Toorak\n\nI’m very satisfied with the cleaning service. I would recommend Inner City Maids to others in a heartbeat.\n#### John – Brighton\n\nA professional company with trustworthy home cleaners. At no time did I ever feel uncomfortable with the cleaner in my home. I have had two cleaners from this agency, and both have always made me feel very comfortable.\n#### Kylie – West Melbourne\n\nWe have an apartment in Port Melbourne. My husband and I work full time and run busy schedules, leaving us little time for cleaning. The regular cleaning service offered by Inner City Maids has made our lives a ton easier.\n### Who is Inner City Maids?\n\nInner City Maids initially started with one person, our founder Paula Rod who began cleaning homes for her clients based in Footscray. Paula's unparalleled attention to quality and detail, and her unique systematic approach to cleaning resulted in the creation of a formula which delivered a consistent high standard cleaning to each home. Her remarkable style of cleaning was noticed shortly by her clients. She became popular and highly recommended amongst her client base for her skills, cleaning system and character.\n\nAs demand for her cleaning expertise grew, Paula coordinated with a network of independent cleaning professionals, all sharing her commitment to quality and detail. Through word-of-mouth recommendations, Paula became well-regarded within the inner west mums community of Melbourne, and the agency's network of registered professional cleaners she facilitated was frequently sought after for their services.\n\nLater on, through further recommendations new clients started pouring in from Melbourne's inner city and inner south east suburbs. Inundated with all the new requests for home cleaning she was faced with two options; to either decline the extra work as her and the team were fully booked out or find a way to be able service new clients without compromising on the quality of service that she has been providing to existing clients. She decided on the latter and as a result founded Inner City Maids, a cleaning agency for Melbourne's inner city suburbs. Formerly known as Inner Melbourne Maids, the agency rebranded to reflect its growing presence beyond Melbourne.\n\nShe formed the agency and its operations based around her experience, know how, proven cleaning system and processes with the goal to ensure that each client will consistently receive a high standard clean, the same she had always been providing her clients herself. She succeeded and as a result of her and the teams efforts Inner City Maids has grown into an award winning house cleaning agency trusted by clients from city to city.\n#### Moonee Ponds Office\n\n🏆 Award Winning House Cleaning\n\nCity to City™\n\n*Walk-ins not available, by appointment only.\n### Vacate Clean, Move Out Clean, End Of Lease Clean Melbourne\n\nMoving out? Let us handle your end of lease cleaning in Melbourne. Our expert house cleaners specialise in making both apartments and houses shine, ensuring your home meets the high standards expected by Melbourne landlords and agents. Our Deep Clean service is meticulously designed for both apartment end of lease cleaning and houses alike, covering every nook and cranny.\n\nWhether you're in a bustling inner-city apartment or a suburban family home, choose our professional house cleaning services for your move out clean and experience a smoother transition. Let our experienced team lighten your load.\n### Hassle-Free Online Booking for NDIS Cleaning Services in Melbourne\n\nEffortlessly maintain a clean home with our NDIS cleaning services in Melbourne. Ideal for both self-managed and plan-managed participants, our online booking system simplifies the process of arranging top-quality NDIS cleaning services. The professional NDIS cleaners in Melbourne that our agency provides focus on creating tailored living spaces that meet your specific needs.\n\nAll regular cleaning services are charged according to the NDIS price guide, ensuring no additional costs for you.\n### Our Cleaning Agency\n\n★★★★★ 5-Star Customer Reviews\n\nDays A Week Cleaning Service\n\nMelbourne Cleaning Service Areas\n"
